6: //! function entry address, so a single cache directory can hold every
7: //! function of every binary the user has touched.
8: //!
9: //! ## On-disk layout
10: //!
11: //! ```text
12: //! <cache_dir>/<binary_hash:016x>/<func_addr:016x>.bin
13: //! ```
14: //!
15: //! Each `.bin` file is a bincode-encoded [`SsaFunction`].
16: //!
17: //! Reads are best-effort: any I/O or decode failure returns `None` rather
18: //! than propagating an error, so a corrupt cache entry degrades gracefully
19: //! to a cache miss instead of crashing the pipeline.
